text:
@katieporteroc Nope. Fuck you. "Rigged elections" talk is for Trump's crowd.

You all played by the same rules and you lost by 20 pts in a 3-way race.

You were great in the House but this tantrum shows exactly why you weren't ready for promotion yet.

