text:
@katieporteroc "Rig?"  See, that's where you lose me.  Loved you as a congresswoman.  It was so smart, holding those CEO's accountable.  But you started to sound like Trump.
This election wasn't "rigged" & it's dangerous for you to say that it was.
You lost, doesn't mean it was rigged.

