text:
@katieporteroc Used to be a 100% fan of Katie Porter.

Now I'm a 0% fan of Katie Porter.

Claiming elections are rigged with no evidence is a hard red line for me. Prove it in court before you claim it in public. Otherwise you are no better than Trump.

